<title>USA: FSA has capacity for WPPSS Projects 1, 2 and 3.</title>
<headline>FSA has capacity for WPPSS Projects 1, 2 and 3.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said Monday it had secondary market insurance capacity for Washington Public Power Supply System revenue bonds, projects 1, 2 and 3.</p>
<p>Capacity is limited to $15 million per firm Monday, and is available first-come, first-served.</p>
<p>For more information, call 212-826-0601.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
